{"id":9080733,"html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-ras/merge_requests/87","number":87,"state":"open","title":"[修复] 完善 Obfuscation 系列 OpAPI 的 Tensor shape 校验","url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-ras/pulls/87","issue_url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-ras/pulls/87/issues","body":"# [修复] 完善 Obfuscation 系列 OpAPI 的 Tensor shape 校验\n\n## 修复摘要\n\n完善 Obfuscation 系列 OpAPI 第一段接口的 Tensor shape 校验。Setup 和 SetupV2\n现在要求输出 `fd` 为一维且长度为 1；Calculate 和 CalculateV2 现在逐维检查\n输出 `y` 与输入 `x` 的 shape 完全一致。非法 shape 在执行器创建前返回\n`ACLNN_ERR_PARAM_INVALID`，避免不符合公开接口约束的 Tensor metadata 继续进入后续流程。\n\n## 变更范围\n\n- `reliability/obfuscation_setup/op_host/op_api/aclnn_obfuscation_setup.cpp`\n- `reliability/obfuscation_setup/op_host/op_api/aclnn_obfuscation_setup_v2.cpp`\n- `reliability/obfuscation_calculate/op_host/op_api/aclnn_obfuscation_calculate.cpp`\n- `reliability/obfuscation_calculate/op_host/op_api/aclnn_obfuscation_calculate_v2.cpp`\n- 为四个接口各增加一个非法 shape 回归用例，覆盖 `fd=[2]` 和同 rank 不同维度的 `x/y`。\n- 修正 UT CMake 对带分号的 compute unit 列表的解析，避免 `map_compute_unit` 和\n  `get_target_dir` 因参数展开错误导致配置失败。\n\n合法 shape、空指针、rank 不同、dtype 不匹配和已有成功路径保持原有行为。\n\n## 测试结果\n\n- Setup/SetupV2 Host OpAPI UT：7/7 通过。\n- Calculate/CalculateV2 Host OpAPI UT：12/12 通过。\n- 新增边界用例均返回 `ACLNN_ERR_PARAM_INVALID (161002)`；已有对照用例全部通过。\n- 测试使用 CANN 9.1.0 Host OpAPI UT 依赖；目标源码与验证环境 Toolkit 版本边界已记录，\n  未声称完成匹配发布版本的 NPU 端到端验证。\n\n关联 Issue: https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-ras/issues/23\n","assignees_number":11,"assignees":[{"id":"68777000fc42115893ad8b8c","login":"songkai111","name":"songkai111","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/songkai111","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822cc0d6a68fa1fec6cc502","login":"zhou-qilong","name":"sunday","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/zhou-qilong","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6880ad5a32fa9627bd89c02f","login":"LiuZonggu","name":"LiuZonggu","avatar_url":"https://cdn-static.gitcode.com/avatars/docs.png","html_url":"https:/